  m_Name: 26
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dossamer.Dialogue.Schema.Cutscene
  Title: 2-6
  Exchanges:
  - Lines:
    - Text: "Janitor 537, AllHuman Solutions\u2122 has identified that you have made
        unsanctioned modifications to corporate cleaning equipment."
      Guid:
        Value: ace9348b-876f-4d41-8930-0513d276f06c
    - Text: Please proceed to the Research & Development building once you are done
        with your duties for the day to avoid termination.
      Guid:
        Value: 996c6ee7-4f11-4e0b-9786-d1de2f6bf76d
    Speaker: AdminAI
    Guid:
      Value: c74df4e7-3673-4862-bd48-c1ddc9308304
  - Lines:
    - Text: Well that sounds concerning. But I'm sure they will see the benefits
        of our friendship, Boardy.
      Guid:
        Value: ce4c37ce-b3b2-4a87-92f9-21fa22fd1ba3
    - Text: You have nothing to be scared of.
      Guid:
        Value: 5a3a511c-fa07-49d0-85e4-fc9950f598c4
    - Text: Ok, now it's time to finish the cleanup here.
      Guid:
        Value: fc4d548f-33cf-45b1-997c-4646ee10b915
    - Text: '[PRESS S WHILE ON RAIL TO JUMP OFF IT]'
      Guid:
        Value: fc4d548f-33cf-45b1-997c-4646ee10b915
    Speaker: The Janitor
    Guid:
      Value: bf4c03b4-0d53-43df-995f-164f3d284118
  Guid:
    Value: 78dcec14-6a8a-4a44-9a61-ad80555b0f72
